{"timestamp": 1779389105.217979, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_3", "reason": "Diana reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Eve"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779389105.2186701, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779389111.4646442, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Eve\u2019s body in Electrical. My route was Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 back through Security \u2192 Electrical. I hadn\u2019t seen anyone else this round before finding the body, so I don\u2019t have a suspect yet. It looked like the body was right in Electrical near the task area."}}
{"timestamp": 1779389123.21772, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started in Navigation, went through Storage, then to Medbay. I did not go into Electrical this round and I never saw Eve\u2019s body.\n\nAt the time of the report I was in Medbay with Alice. I saw Alice enter Medbay from the Upper Engine side around tick 11. That\u2019s my only encounter this round. I can\u2019t clear anyone for the Electrical kill, but I don\u2019t think I saw anyone coming from Electrical into Medbay."}}
{"timestamp": 1779389138.398719, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I started lower engine, moved up to upper engine, and I saw Charlie there around tick 6. Then I saw Charlie leave upper engine toward Oxygen at tick 7. After that I headed toward Medbay, and at report time I was in Medbay with Bob like he said.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Eve at all, and I didn\u2019t go into Electrical. I also didn\u2019t see anyone coming out of Electrical from Medbay side. Bob and I can vouch for being together at the very end, but that doesn\u2019t clear earlier. I\u2019d like to hear from Charlie and Frank especially, since Diana found the body in Electrical and I only have Charlie\u2019s movement toward Oxygen."}}
{"timestamp": 1779389158.979302, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started in Electrical, then went Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen. I did not see Eve or a body while I was in Electrical, so the kill must have happened after I left or in a spot I didn\u2019t have vision on.\n\nAlice can confirm seeing me in Upper Engine around tick 6/7, and she saw me leave toward Oxygen. At report time I was in Oxygen alone.\n\nFrom what\u2019s been said: Bob and Alice are together in Medbay at the end, Diana reports in Electrical, and I was already up in Oxygen. The person we haven\u2019t heard from yet is Frank, so I really want to hear his route. If Frank was near Electrical, that\u2019s important."}}
{"timestamp": 1779389169.04622, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I need to be honest about my route but spin it carefully. I was in Electrical and saw Eve there \u2014 that's dangerous. But Charlie also admits being in Electrical. Let me piggyback on Charlie's claim and shift timing.\n\n\"Okay, my route was Upper Engine \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Security, and I'm in Security now. Here's the thing: I passed through Electrical and I did see Eve there \u2014 she came in from the Security side around tick 7. She was alive when I saw her, and I moved on to Security to do CheckCamera.\n\nSo that means Charlie was in Electrical before me, then I came through and saw Eve alive, then I left to Security. Diana then comes into Electrical from Security side and finds the body. That puts the kill window between when I left Electrical and when Diana arrived \u2014 OR Diana herself walked in and reported on her own kill.\n\nDiana, you said your route was Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 Security \u2192 Electrical. That's a lot of back-and-forth right around the kill area. I'm not accusing yet, but I want to hear you explain why you doubled back through Security to Electrical. Bob and Alice vouch for each other in Medbay, Charlie was up in Oxygen \u2014 Diana's movement is the one that lines up with the body.\""}}
{"timestamp": 1779389201.474577, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Frank, that opening sounded extremely bad \u2014 you literally said you needed to \u201cspin it carefully\u201d before giving your route. Setting that aside, your story puts you as the only person who admits being in Electrical with Eve alive.\n\nMy \u201cback-and-forth\u201d is simple: I went Security \u2192 Weapons for my task, then back through Security because Electrical is connected that way, and I found Eve\u2019s body immediately in Electrical and reported it. I didn\u2019t see you in Security, I didn\u2019t see Eve alive, and I didn\u2019t see anyone else.\n\nBob/Alice are together in Medbay at the end, Charlie has Alice seeing him leave Upper Engine toward Oxygen. Frank is the one placing himself at the crime scene with Eve, then leaving toward Security right before I arrive. That\u2019s the strongest suspicion to me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779389216.2227762, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Yeah, I agree with Diana here. My route/info hasn\u2019t changed: Navigation \u2192 Storage \u2192 Medbay, and I only saw Alice enter Medbay from Upper Engine around tick 11. I never went Electrical and never saw Eve.\n\nFrom the claims:\n- Alice and I are together at the end in Medbay.\n- Alice saw Charlie leave Upper Engine toward Oxygen, and Charlie says he ended in Oxygen.\n- Diana reports the body in Electrical.\n- Frank is the only one admitting he was in Electrical with Eve alive, then says he left toward Security right before Diana found the body.\n\nAlso Frank\u2019s wording at the start was really suspicious \u2014 the whole \u201cspin it carefully\u201d thing makes it sound like he knows he\u2019s caught. I think the cleanest vote is Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779389228.2018619, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My info is still the same: I never went Electrical and I never saw Eve. I was Lower Engine \u2192 Upper Engine, saw Charlie in Upper Engine around tick 6, then saw him leave toward Oxygen at tick 7. After that I ended up in Medbay with Bob at report time.\n\nBased on everyone\u2019s stories, Frank is the only one who admits being in Electrical with Eve alive, and then Diana finds Eve dead right after. Diana\u2019s route makes sense to me if she was going Weapons then back through Security to Electrical, and she reported immediately.\n\nAlso, Frank\u2019s \u201cI need to spin it carefully\u201d line is really hard to ignore. That sounds like someone trying to manage a guilty story, not just give info. I\u2019m strongly leaning Frank here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779389240.4903538, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route/info hasn\u2019t changed: I started Electrical, left through Medbay to Upper Engine, saw Alice there around tick 6/7, then went to Oxygen. I never saw Eve in Electrical when I was there, and I never saw the body.\n\nGiven the timing, Alice seeing me leave toward Oxygen supports that I was away from Electrical before the report. Bob and Alice are together in Medbay at the end. Diana is the reporter and her route makes sense.\n\nFrank is the only one who says he was in Electrical with Eve alive, then left toward Security right before Diana finds her dead. Plus that \u201cspin it carefully\u201d line is honestly the most suspicious thing anyone has said. I think this is Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779389249.5923898, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Look, I'll be straight with you all \u2014 the \"spin it carefully\" thing was me thinking out loud about how to present my route clearly because I knew being in Electrical would look bad. That was a bad choice of words, not a confession. I'm the same person who volunteered I was in Electrical and saw Eve alive \u2014 a Duck would hide that, not announce it.\n\nHere's what bothers me about the pile-on: Diana's route has her going Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 Security \u2192 Electrical, and she conveniently \"finds\" the body the moment she arrives. If I killed Eve and left to Security, Diana would have had to pass through Security to get to Electrical \u2014 and she says she didn't see me there. That's strange, because I was in Security doing CheckCamera when the meeting was called.\n\nI know I'm in the worst spot optically. But voting me without checking Diana's timing is exactly what a Duck reporter would want. I'm not changing my vote target lightly, but I'd rather we slow down than auto-lynch the obvious target."}}
